@startuml
title Leader Election with PreVote (§4.2.3 / §5.2)
skinparam defaultFontSize 10

participant "Candidate\n(Node A)" as A
participant "Follower\n(Node B)" as B
participant "Follower\n(Node C)" as C

note over A: Election timeout fires\n(no heartbeat received)
== PreVote Phase (§4.2.3) ==
A -> A: Check: not removed from config
A -> B: PreVoteRequest(term=T+1, lastLogIndex, lastLogTerm)
A -> C: PreVoteRequest(term=T+1, lastLogIndex, lastLogTerm)

note over B: Grant if:\n1. Log is up-to-date\n2. No recent leader heartbeat
B --> A: PreVoteResponse(voteGranted=true)
C --> A: PreVoteResponse(voteGranted=true)

note over A: PreVote majority received\nProceed to real election

== Real Election (§5.2) ==
A -> A: Increment term to T+1\nVote for self\nBecome CANDIDATE

A -> B: RequestVoteRequest(term=T+1, candidateId=A, ...)
A -> C: RequestVoteRequest(term=T+1, candidateId=A, ...)

B --> A: RequestVoteResponse(voteGranted=true)
C --> A: RequestVoteResponse(voteGranted=true)

note over A: Majority votes received!\nBecome LEADER

== Leader Established ==
A -> A: Append no-op entry (§8)\nInit nextIndex/matchIndex
A -> B: AppendEntries (heartbeat + no-op)
A -> C: AppendEntries (heartbeat + no-op)
@enduml
